    skos:prefLabel 'Orolia Spectracom'@en ;
    skos:definition 'A company of the Orolia group since 2007. Spectracom was originally founded in Rochester, New York USA in 1972. It is a manufacturer of precision time and frequency instruments and network-centric equipment used in a wide range of industries.'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:L35::MAN0139'^^xsd:string .
