    skos:prefLabel 'Northrop Grumman Sperry Marine'@en ;
    skos:definition 'A provider of navigation solutions, including radars, compass systems, steering systems, speed logs, integrated bridge and control systems. Established in 1997 from three well-known names in the marine industry: Sperry Gyrocompass, C. Plath and Decca. Formed part of the Northrop Grumman group in 2001.'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:L35::MAN0138'^^xsd:string .
