    skos:prefLabel 'ESE'@en ;
    skos:definition 'A company founded in 1971 in California, USA. ESE specialises in digital clocks and timers, digital multi-meters, digital frequency counters, and more recently GPS master clocks, with applications in a variety of fields, including the broadcast, communication and military industries.'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:L35::MAN0137'^^xsd:string .
