    skos:definition 'An international engineering company based in Connecticut, USA, founded in 1962. The company specialises in instrumentation, primarily for the measurement of temperature, pressure, humidity, and flow and level. In addition to this the company designs and manufactures data loggers and recorders.'@en ;
