    skos:prefLabel 'Microtrac'@en ;
    skos:definition 'Based in the USA, Microtrac is a pioneer and leading manufacturer of light scattering instruments for particle analysis. While Microtrac existed first as a business segment within a larger organization, the company Microtrac Inc. was ultimately founded in 1999.'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:L35::MAN0128'^^xsd:string .
