    skos:altLabel 'TSS'^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'Teledyne TSS'@en ;
    skos:definition 'Based in Aberdeen, UK, Teledyne TSS specialises in the design, manufacture and support of marine products for applications including navigation, motion compensation, platform stabilisation, and subsea pipe and cable survey. Founded in 1903 as S.G. Brown Ltd, it eventually merged with TSS to become TSS International. It was subsequently purchased by Teledyne in 2008.'@en ;
