    skos:prefLabel 'Subsea Technology and Rentals Ltd.'@en ;
    skos:definition 'A specialist technology company providing rental and sales services globally to the offshore marine sectors. Originally named Sonar Equipment Services (SES), the company re-branded to STR in February 2014 to better reflect the range of products and services supplied.'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:L35::MAN0105'^^xsd:string .
