    skos:prefLabel 'Davis Instruments'@en ;
    skos:definition 'A company that specialises in instruments that measure marine weather. The company was acquired by Jim Acquistapace and Bob Selig in 1969. In 2019, Davis Instruments became part of the Advanced Environmental Monitoring group.'@en ;
