    skos:altLabel 'HTI'^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'High Tech Inc.'@en ;
    skos:definition 'A company that specialises in manufacturing hydrophones and data acquisition instrumentation for use by the Navy and worldwide seismic community. High Tech products and systems have been selected to meet the stringent requirements of military applications including Anti-Submarine Warfare, Propulsion Noise Test Systems, Torpedo Testing, Marine Ambient Noise, Arctic Noise Monitoring and Surveillance. Founded and incorporated in the state of Mississippi in 1989.'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:L35::MAN0099'^^xsd:string .
