    skos:prefLabel 'Sunburst Sensors'@en ;
    skos:definition 'A US-based company that specialises in the design and manufacture of autonomous instruments that measure marine and freshwater inorganic carbon parameters pCO2 (partial pressure of carbon dioxide) and pH using patented drift-free technology. It was founded in 1999.'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:L35::MAN0097'^^xsd:string .
