    skos:prefLabel 'Hach'@en ;
    skos:definition 'A global company that specialises in the manufacture and distribution of analytical instruments and reagents for quality testing of water and other liquid solutions in both laboratory and field settings. The company was founded in Iowa, USA in 1947, and is now headquartered in Colorado, USA.'@en ;
